r considering my request.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CDveMfP4Re2fT6bA5phd0_IHZDFOJ1Yc", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@xxxS__N/works/40", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1370713, "client_id": 13278, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/96219270/uploads/origins/4f8a6333-ce97-4b34-80ea-5fc214d93a7d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=166af513b2b6ee2d9dc41744643ef0a7", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/96219270/uploads/origins/4f8a6333-ce97-4b34-80ea-5fc214d93a7d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=27fee1f66caf0123d7e543b8980ca55f", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello, sensei!! May I request an illustration? The character is a mage who pursues knowledge at all costs. He made a pact with a demon to gain knowledge. Evil and manipulative. His visual themes are death, the color red, and red spider lilies. Here is some visual inspiration (please ignore if you do not find it helpful): https://br.pinterest.com/languhiris/aliah/\n\nI would like a dark or strange atmosphere, please.\n\nPlease draw the hair as it is drawn in the second reference image. The curls are looser and fluffier.\n\nPlease put any text on a separate layer in the PSD that can be turned on and off.\n\nThank you very much for considering my request!! (I am very sorry if the machine translation is rude.)\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/XzwaIGt", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@xxxS__N/works/39", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1370713, "client_id": 1699615, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/36a5b74d/uploads/origins/c020721a-b438-4366-b64d-0216795aaf40?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=528ce1ff40f4d0182f1df8291f949d60", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/36a5b74d/uploads/origins/c020721a-b438-4366-b64d-0216795aaf40?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=00929aa677b77f5a489e27b782dc3690", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hi, I love your use of colors and portrayals of characters! Can I request you to draw an illustration for my original character?\n\nAge30-35. A sexy and elegant type with a thin and neutral appearance. He used to be an aristocrat and is a bit tsundere.\n\nI wish he was in a dream-like room with tall plants and strange specimens around him, looking fiercely at the camera with blood on his body.\n\nIf this request is inappropriate for you, please feel free to cancel this request. Thank you very much!! ><\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1h2Ajc3SaF-fnjbhp1AOG6Hk4RdHJNm9Y?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@xxxS__N/works/38", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1370713, "client_id": 143820, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/113d493e/uploads/origins/af6d45d3-122a-44e1-89ce-0efa9aa3c0e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cfaa52fa753cc241a5afc36674e595e4", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/113d493e/uploads/origins/af6d45d3-122a-44e1-89ce-0efa9aa3c0e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ac46e9f296c97a55f0674673dc713295", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは、はじめまして。あなたの作品がとても好きです。\n今回は私のオリジナルキャラクター「リューテス」をお願いしたいです。彼は連続殺人犯で、無垢な姿の裏に隠れるようにしています。とても面白みのない、淡々とした人物なのですが、仮面を被ると性格が一変します。彼は被害者に事前に死を知らせるメモを送ります。\nあまり問題がなければ、暗くて邪悪なテーマを希望します。彼のデザインはどちらか好きな方を描いてください。ポーズや表情など、自由に描いていただいて構いません。\n可能であれば、サインはPSDファイルの別レイヤーにしていただきたいです。ご検討のほど、よろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1tUBtfi-sYgqAREK-RS-738-GimnaX8Se?usp=sharing", "nc": 9, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@xxxS__N/works/37", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2f637bc4/uploads/origins/3b1885de-4c21-4b0f-8196-aba953d3b8c4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3b304a183c357dcf536b12f20381e24f", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1370713, "client_id": 936070, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@xxxS__N/works/36", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1370713, "client_id": 302676, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4aa5e924/uploads/origins/1a31bc66-a444-41d0-ba35-03513684f526?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=98e1bd116b1b983c4d957970876464dd", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4aa5e924/uploads/origins/1a31bc66-a444-41d0-ba35-03513684f526?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=53ec00969547645d83df8a9a7c7b4566", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは。私のキャラクター「みゆき」のアートをお願いできますか？できればピンクの衣装でお願いします\nhttps://i.imgur.com/x46R1ql.jpg\n\n普段は明るく楽しいアイドル系ですが、戦う時はとても恐ろしくて強くて暴力的なんです。戦っている時、もしくは戦いの後、敵の血が